     while _/_u_s_r_/_*_/_X_1_1 would not match either.  Likewise, _/_u_s_r_/_*_/_b_i_n would
     match _/_u_s_r_/_l_o_c_a_l_/_b_i_n but not _/_u_s_r_/_b_i_n.

